-# locals: enabled (Boolean) — the stored state, for the checkbox.
-#
-# Offered only for a Work with video content: StreamingOnly.applicable? on the
-# edit page, StagedVideoProbe at deposit, where the Blob may still be in flight.
-#
-# The unchecked hidden field rides along deliberately. A cleared checkbox submits
-# nothing, so without it the controller cannot tell "turn this off" from "this
-# form does not own the field" — and the Permissions and Metadata tabs both PATCH
-# the same action with disjoint fields, so that distinction is load-bearing.
%hr.section-divider.my-3

.my-3.rounded-3
  %h4.pb-2
    %i.fa-solid.fa-film.me-2{ 'aria-hidden' => 'true' }
    Streaming Only
  .form-check
    = hidden_field_tag 'work[streaming_only]', '0', id: nil
    = check_box_tag 'work[streaming_only]', '1', enabled, class: 'form-check-input'
    %label.form-check-label{ for: 'work_streaming_only' }
      Play this video on its page, but do not offer it for download
  %p.text-muted.small.mt-2.mb-0
    Media marked as “streaming only” can only be viewed in the browser and may not
    be downloaded for offline viewing or sharing.

%hr.section-divider.mt-3.mb-0
